{"reviews":[{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-0","r":5.0,"t":"The best and most natural falsies for asian eyes!!","x":"[[VIDEOID:b5e8a566f83c8feb9fc5ce6992d8d581]] Omg I need to stock up on these babies!! They are beautiful and really complimented my almond shape eyes! Perfect for everyday look. I didn't even need to cut these cause it fits my eye shape perfectly! Will order again.  Update: My update is not like any other. In fact Im telling all of you that this is the best buy there is!! I have only been USING ONE from the moment it arrived here and guess what?! It was freaking sturdy. I've been using one and j","h":53,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-1","r":5.0,"t":"great natural lashes for monolids","x":"I have monolids and it is near impossible to find lashes that look natural, but these work so well! 10/10","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-2","r":1.0,"t":"Nothing like the picture","x":"The picture shows thick shorter natural looking  dark lashes. I got sparse, very thin, \u201clong lashes\u201d. Definitely NOT as advertised.","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-3","r":5.0,"t":"A little fragile, but great for natural Asian eyes.","x":"Great cheap alternative for Asian eyes! 7mm length is perfect for me and matches my Asian eyes. I get a lot of compliments and It\u2019s hard for me to find lashes this length. I know I can cut them from others but it\u2019s such a hassle sometimes when these are precut perfectly for me.  What I don\u2019t like is that it\u2019s a little fragile. If I tug on it horizontally when removing old glue it\u2019s too easy to remove a couple lashes from the strip. If it stayed on better to the strip itself it would be the perfe","h":15,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-4","r":5.0,"t":"These look like lash extensions!!","x":"These lashes are so flattering and natural on almond hooded eyes! They are very lightweight and easy to apply. They are on the fragile side so be careful when removing them from your eyes/packaging. I purchased more of these because they are natural but have just enough volume that they look like lash extensions. Love them!!","h":14,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Highly recommended","x":"Finally, I found the perfect eyelashes for my eyes. Looks super nature, it\u2019s perfect for daily makeup, but it if you wanna have effortless makeup look. This is my second time order it.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love at first sight","x":"The moment I put them on I fell in love. \u2764\ufe0f I immediately went to buy another pair. They are very comfy and very easy to apply. They are more on the natural looking side so if you\u2019re looking for just a subtle look these are perfect. They feel like nothing on the eyes and it really completed my makeup look. 10/10 I\u2019m so happy And for so pretty.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Very natural looking","x":"Good if you just want to enhance your own natural eyelashes.  I added mascara to them to make them a little bit thicker. Good for when you don't want to wear eyeliner or much eye makeup.  Love these","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-8","r":5.0,"t":"10 STARS!!","x":"I looooove these. I tried some lashes from another company with magnetic liner and they were so easy to use and I lived that BUT I want a VERY VERY natural look and I just couldn\u2019t find a pair that didn\u2019t have a big black strip and they all looked harsh. These are absolutely perfect. So natural. My lashes only better. They are normal falsies but I got used to doing it because I wear these every day now so it only takes me approx 1 minute per eye. No $400 a month for eyelash extensions . Cant ima","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect\ud83d\udc9c\ud83d\udc9c","x":"Comfortable and perfect design for my eyes! Love it 10/10","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2023"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-10","r":5.0,"t":"Great for hooded eyes","x":"These looked pretty natural and were easy to put on.  They have a clear band and it\u2019s not stiff.  I didn\u2019t do a great job putting these on in this photo and they still look good.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-11","r":5.0,"t":"Lush and natural","x":"I really love these because they look natural. I don\u2019t wear lashes everyday but when I want to make my eyes pop these lashes are a must.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-12","r":1.0,"t":"Complete lies!","x":"They look nothing like the photo. They are way too long and don\u2019t look natural at all. It is a waste of money to get these.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-13","r":2.0,"t":"Needs major design Improvement....","x":"The lash itself is pretty and natural looking, however the clear band is thick like plastic, very noticeable, stiff and uncomfortable to wear, which was disappointing. It is impossible to get the lash to fit the curve of the eye, and the band does not camouflage when applied. If they change the lash band this product would be great, but as of now I would not recommend the product as it is.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-14","r":4.0,"t":"Very cute","x":"A little short but perfect for a natural look","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-15","r":4.0,"t":"Nature and lightweight","x":"I like this shorter version of the eyelash. You don't need to cut it before use it. Very nature and easy to put on. Lightweight is the best feature. You can reuse it for few times if you clean the glue on the eyelash. The price is good and the material of the eyelash is not bad.","h":4,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-16","r":4.0,"t":"super cute :)","x":"they are really cute enhancements if you\u2019re looking for something super natural but the band is visible unless you have very hooded eyes. i recommend using black glue. but they are super cute and comfy.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-17","r":5.0,"t":"best for asian eyes","x":"so cute and still very dramatic if you like dat 10/10","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-18","r":5.0,"t":"These are the cutest eyelashes ever!","x":"They\u2019re so easy to put on and super soft! Def will buy again ! Thank u!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-19","r":1.0,"t":"Don\u2019t buy these!!!!","x":"The lashes feel cheap and are falling off of the band!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-20","r":5.0,"t":"my new best friend","x":"i got the one identified as GM08.  SO much easier to put on, i usually have to re-do, move, and wiggle the lashes when i put them on.  this was a much faster experience. they brighten & open up my eyes, i don't even need eyeliner.  others i have give are heavier and i am constantly checking to make sure they aren't moving up on my eyelid.  these are so light it doesn't even feel like i have anything on, plus i don't see them our of the corner of my eye.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-21","r":1.0,"t":"Cheaply made and they don\u2019t hold up","x":"I\u2019ve been wearing lashes for decades.  These are the worst I\u2019ve ever bought.  Cannot put glue because band is too thin and once you so, the glue cannot be removednos the lashes cannot be worn even twice.  Save your money.  These are just bad lashes.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-22","r":1.0,"t":"NOT GOOD :(","x":"They are not good quality! DO NOT BUY! once i pulled the lashes out of the packaging the lashes completely ripped out into pieces not worth the money","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-23","r":5.0,"t":"Natural look","x":"These lashes are beautiful. They look natural yet elegant. I wore them during my  workout and they stayed on the entire time.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09YLH7JMJ-24","r":5.0,"t":"Natural beauty","x":"I love these lashes. I use the clear glue for it. Lashes look so natural, perfect for my small Asian eyes \ud83d\ude0d","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2023"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise these lashes as natural-looking and well-suited to Asian, almond, hooded, and monolid eye shapes.","cites":[1,2,4,5,11]},{"text":"Many customers find them comfortable and easy to apply, often describing them as lightweight and effortless.","cites":[5,7,10,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the lashes are fragile and require careful handling.","cites":[4,5]},{"text":"A few customers complain the lashes look nothing like the photos, being too long, thin, or sparse rather than natural.","cites":[3,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers report issues with the clear band being thick, stiff, and uncomfortable, making it hard to fit the eye curve.","cites":[14]}]},"qa":[]}